@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #2d3142
skinparam ArrowColor #4f5d75
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #ececec
skinparam NoteBorderColor #bfc0c0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam activityBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam stateBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam classBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam classBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam circleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam circleBorderColor #2d3142
title Sequence — UC-08 / UC-09 danh mục (Plant; Disease tương tự)
actor "Khách / User / Admin" as User
participant "Web catalogApi / API caller" as Web
note over User,Web: Web: User đã đăng nhập/restore. Khách: chỉ gọi API trực tiếp.
participant "PlantsController + authorization" as API
participant PlantService as Service
database "PlantRepository / PostgreSQL" as DB
User -> Web : yêu cầu danh mục
Web -> API : GET /api/plants?includeInactive=false\nhoặc GET /api/plants/{id}
API -> Service : GetAllAsync / GetByIdAsync
Service -> DB : query
DB --> Service : entities
Service --> API : PlantDto/list hoặc null
API --> Web : 200 hoặc detail 404
Web --> User : danh mục (web có dữ liệu tĩnh dự phòng)
opt thao tác Admin qua API
 Web -> API : POST /api/plants hoặc PUT/DELETE /{id}\nBearer JWT
 alt JWT sai hoặc role không Admin
  API --> Web : 401 / 403
 else Admin hợp lệ
  API -> Service : CreateAsync / UpdateAsync / DeleteAsync
  Service -> DB : tải record khi update/delete
  DB --> Service : entity hoặc null
  alt ID không tồn tại ở update/delete
   Service --> API : KeyNotFoundException
   API --> Web : middleware 404
  else tiếp tục tạo/sửa/xóa
   Service -> DB : Add/Update/Delete / SaveChanges
   alt unique hoặc FK RESTRICT error
    DB --> Service : DbUpdateException
    Service --> API : exception
    API --> Web : middleware thường 500
   else thành công
    DB --> Service : saved
    Service --> API : DTO hoặc completed
    API --> Web : POST 201 / PUT 200 / DELETE 204
   end
  end
 end
end
note over API,DB
DiseasesController/DiseaseService/DiseaseRepository
có API /api/diseases tương ứng.
Chưa thấy UI Admin; API caller không đồng nghĩa màn hình.
end note
@enduml
